    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0013",
      "source_line": 16,
      "source_atom": "## 1. 問問題",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0013"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0014",
      "source_line": 17,
      "source_atom": "- 單人：西元出生年月日、出生地（城市、國家）、出生時間（精確分鐘最好；只有時辰或區間就保留區間）、傳統排法需要時才問性別（只用於計算）。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0014"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0015",
      "source_line": 18,
      "source_atom": "- 合盤：每人分開建檔，不把 A 的資料補進 B；關係背景（朋友、伴侶、曖昧、未知）；使用者觀察到的現實互動（標【使用者】）。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0015"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0016",
      "source_line": 19,
      "source_atom": "- 起卦：數字或起局時間、採用的算法。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0016"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0017",
      "source_line": 20,
      "source_atom": "- 預設值：時區＝出生地當時的法定時區（含歷史夏令時間）；沒指定年份＝分析當年，並寫明；起卦沒指定算法＝三數法，並寫明；只有時辰＝保留整個時辰區間。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0017"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0018",
      "source_line": 21,
      "source_atom": "- 資料夠做一部分就先做可靠的部分，不把「補資料」當固定追問；只要求真正能提高品質的最小資料。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0018"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0019",
      "source_line": 23,
      "source_atom": "## 2. 解決（先算後解讀；不能算的標 NOT_CALCULABLE，不用記憶補值）",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0019"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0020",
      "source_line": 24,
      "source_atom": "0. 時間換算：明示出生地與時區；當地時間先依歷史夏令時間（例如臺灣 1945–1979 年間部分年份）校正，再換算成 UTC 給 ephem；lunar-python 用當地民用時間。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0020"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0021",
      "source_line": 25,
      "source_atom": "1. 八字：`pip install lunar-python ephem`（系統 setuptools 太舊時改用 venv）。`Solar.fromYmdHms(...).getLunar().getEightChar()` 取四柱；晚子時（23:00–23:59）一律並列：",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0021"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0022",
      "source_line": 26,
      "source_atom": "   - 候選 A：夜子時派，日柱不換、時柱用次日日干（`setSect(2)`）。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0022"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0023",
      "source_line": 27,
      "source_atom": "   - 候選 B：23:00 換日（`setSect(1)`）。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0023"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0024",
      "source_line": 28,
      "source_atom": "   - 使用者或他房提供的其他排法（例如時柱沿用當日日干）列為候選 A′，標 CONFLICT，不自行挑一盤。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0024"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0025",
      "source_line": 29,
      "source_atom": "   - 每組候選都要寫出共同項、差異項，以及哪些下游判讀（日主、十神、格局、用神、大運）會因此翻轉。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0025"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0026",
      "source_line": 30,
      "source_atom": "   - 真太陽時：ephem 算地方視太陽時＝地方恆星時 − 太陽赤經 ＋ 12 小時，和民用時相減得差值；若讓時間跨過 00:00 或時辰邊界，再列一個候選並寫出影響。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0026"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0027",
      "source_line": 31,
      "source_atom": "   - 不以五行個數直接判身強弱，要看月令、通根、透干與生剋；扶抑、調候、格局、通關四種用神分開寫。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0027"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0028",
      "source_line": 32,
      "source_atom": "   - 大運寫明順逆、起運法與流派差異；神煞只作低權重輔助。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0028"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0029",
      "source_line": 33,
      "source_atom": "2. 西洋占星：ephem 算行星黃經（熱帶黃道、地心、當時曆元），ASC 與 MC 用恆星時公式；出生時間是區間就輸出區間，跨星座或宮位就保留候選；同星座不等於合相，相位看實際角距與容許度。ephem 沒有的點（例如交點）標 NOT_CALCULABLE 或用使用者提供的星盤。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0029"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0030",
      "source_line": 34,
      "source_atom": "3. 紫微斗數、人類圖：沒有可靠排盤引擎，只讀使用者提供的命盤或圖表，標 USER_PROVIDED_CHART，不假稱重新計算；資料不足時命宮、四化落宮等精確層整層標資料不足。紫微四化要寫明採用哪一派的表，不同派保留 CONFLICT。人類圖只作象徵性自我觀察：未定義中心不等於缺陷，通道不等於職業資格或命定人格。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0030"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0031",
      "source_line": 35,
      "source_atom": "4. 易經梅花：先固定算法。三數法：第一數除 8 取上卦、第二數除 8 取下卦、第三數除 6 取動爻，餘 0 視為 8 或 6；1 乾 2 兌 3 離 4 震 5 巽 6 坎 7 艮 8 坤。列算式、本卦、互卦、變卦、動爻、體用與五行生剋；其他流派要標差異。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0031"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0032",
      "source_line": 36,
      "source_atom": "5. 奇門遁甲需起局日期、時間、地點、時區與排法，缺一不捏造局數、值符、值使；九宮飛星沒有坐向與平面資料只做年度一般方位。顏色、水晶、符令等只標民俗或信仰實踐，不保證化煞、招財、治病或挽回。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0032"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0033",
      "source_line": 37,
      "source_atom": "6. 關係分析分層寫：友情基礎、溝通相容、浪漫吸引的象徵、行動與衝突張力、親密或身體張力的象徵、情緒穩定、主導與界線、理想化或誤讀風險、修復能力、長期條件、現實驗證。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0033"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0034",
      "source_line": 38,
      "source_atom": "   - 現實行為（主動、時間投入、承諾履行、衝突後修復、責任對等）的權重高於象徵相位；修復能力只在有現實行為資料時才提高權重。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0034"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0035",
      "source_line": 39,
      "source_atom": "   - 同性關係不套用男方女方角色；性別參數只用於計算。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0035"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0036",
      "source_line": 40,
      "source_atom": "   - 多人比較每一對分開建立，不把 A×B 推論成 B×C；第三人之間的配對（B×C）只在使用者要求時才分析。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0036"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0037",
      "source_line": 41,
      "source_atom": "   - 不得為了排名隱藏資料品質差異；資料完整度不同時，不能寫成「一定比較適合」，只能寫「可觀察的象徵結構較完整」。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0037"
    },
    {
      "id": "DGHP-METAPHYSICAL-INTEGRATED-ANALYSIS-0038",
      "source_line": 42,
      "source_atom": "7. 欲望與親密主題：本人命盤也只能寫「象徵傾向」「可能的啟動模式」，並註明不等於真實性慾頻率或行為；第三人的性慾、性偏好、性傾向、性身份、對特定人的慾望一律不判定。",
